heir environmental processes. No automatic inheritance of mastery or assignment of caretakers. Other participants must independently choose, communicate and perform any work. All resource transactions and interruption rules execute in code, with idempotent event IDs and no repeated model adjudication.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":3,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Three personal study rounds are required; review and implementation waiting do not advance them or the world. Study, requests, naming, registration and obtaining the capability award no pleasure, satisfaction or mastery reward. Real planting/tending may support modest personally applicable practice benefit, and a verified observation—including an informative failure—may support information-gain benefit. Enforce in code: at most 0.2 short pleasure per completed, applicable event, total cultivation pleasure capped at 0.5 per actor in a rolling 10-round window; duplicate observations of unchanged facts yield zero. Short pleasure expires over at most five elapsed rounds. Maintained cultivation satisfaction accrues only from actual useful care or verified learning, at most 0.01 per qualifying round to a cultivation contribution cap of 0.2, decaying by 0.002 per elapsed round without qualifying activity. Deduplicate the same functional event against probe, gathering and other practice rewards; familiar useful care need not be novel. Inconclusive repeated checks, failed placement and merely scheduled work do not qualify. No benefit overrides hunger, nutrition, health or permissions; no physical-comfort increase is inherent here, and any independently justified comfort remains globally capped at 10. Never alter protected reward accounts, budgets or goals.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Use reusable cultivation metadata: bed ID, position, footprint, substrate appearance, input resource, count, observed stage, condition, work progress and last actual observation. Emit observable events for completed soil preparation/placement, actual tending, observed emergence, maturation, harvest, wilting and death only when those changes occur. Proposed reusable stages are prepared, planted-unverified, rooted-observed, growing, harvestable, stressed and dead; unknown stages remain unknown. A planting trial shows disturbed soil and only physically exposed material, not invented leaves. Progress indicators describe completed labor or measured biological progress, never guaranteed viability or countdown-to-success without a validated recipe. Failed or interrupted actions show the actual partial work and failure reason, not a completed green crop. Hidden viability and resource pools must not leak through colors, labels or event metadata. Visuals and cosmetic labels alone confer neither functional growth nor experience.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

